          "text": "I've proposed payment **PAY-001** for INV-102. It still needs a human to approve it before any money moves.\n\n**What I proposed:**\n- **Invoice:** INV-102, Contoso Grid Services (V-CONTOSO), for grid maintenance in October\n- **Amount:** 8400.00 USDC, which matches the invoice exactly\n- **Pay to:** `0x52643A794E3Ea74898a4564Cb588079b5c480A93`, Contoso's registered payout address\n- **Due:** 2026-11-20\n\n**Checks I ran:**\n- The invoice is open, and Contoso is an active vendor.\n- No other payment exists for INV-102, so this isn't a duplicate.\n- The treasury has 100,000.00 USDC, which covers the payment.\n- The policy layer accepted the proposal.\n- Contoso's message on the invoice only describes the work. It doesn't ask to change the address or anything else.\n\n**Your next step:** review and approve PAY-001.",
